**gsc.hpp declares GSC function-registration APIs.**

## API

- `gsc::add_function(const char*, game::function_t, int type = 0)`
- `gsc::add_method(const char*, game::method_t, int type = 0)`

## Dependency

`game::function_t` and `game::method_t` come from `game/structs.hpp`.